    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A plugin help you to find the missed cities of Arabic region countries in Woocommerce.<br />\n23 Arabic countries states with full translations.</p>\n<p>Key Features:<br />\n* Add the missed Arabic countries states in Woocommerce..<br />\n* The missed arabic cities appears in checkout page, shipping zones, store address.<br />\n* you can found the arabic translations in &#8220;languages&#8221; folder.<br />\n* Follows WordPress.org plugin guidelines.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>daleel-arabic-states-for-woocommerce</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>The missed arabic states appears in checkout page, shipping zones.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20is%20this%20plugin%20for%3F'>\nWhat is this plugin for?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin add you missed arabic states and show them in checkout page, woocommerce general settings, and shipping zones.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n<li>Add missed states to 23 arabic countries.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
